  "notes": "The county ballot carries one 'Member of Republican County Committee' contest per precinct with Vote For 1, so each of the 125 precincts has one seat here; the party rule behind the single seat was not located. The only 2026 primary results the county had posted when checked are labeled UNOFFICIAL (final count dated 05/29/2026); no official write-in winners list for 2026 was posted. Status rules: filed candidate with votes = filled (unknown if write-ins exceeded that candidate); no filed candidate = unknown when any write-in votes were cast (the report lists named write-ins, often 1-3 votes each), empty when none were. Appointments after the primary are not reflected."
